**Profile**: Title: Tiger's Maw, Origin: Huanglong.

The Tiger's Maw Mine primarily produces Lampylumen along with other ore deposits, as well as a minor quantity of Tacetite ores.
'''Tiger's Maw''' is a region in [[Huanglong]] located to the south of [[Jinzhou]], most notable for its large mine.

